{"name": "Lost in Tandem", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Lost In Tandem\u00a0</i>is a colorful, relaxed-paced, 2D adventure-puzzle game, which can be played by one to two players via couch co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Earth Heals after Devastation Strikes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the '90s, a cataclysm marks the end of the world as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over numerous decades of humanity's absence, the Earth slowly recovers as nature finally reclaims its rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Embark on an Epic Journey</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this post-apocalyptic world, a solitary young girl stumbles upon an obsolete and defective robot known as a\u00a0<i>Mech-ute</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together, they embark on a journey guided by the sole information still programmed in the Mech-ute's deteriorated system: a set of geographic coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a diverse panel of locations\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Overcome Obstacles Together</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our duo will have to team up to face various challenges to reach their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They will brave the elements, explore lush colorful landscapes, uncover relics from the turn of the 21st century and encounter a handful of peculiar individuals along the way. Throughout their quest, our duo's relationship will flourish in this heartfelt story that promotes one of the most precious things of all:\u00a0<i><strong>hope</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The remaining question is... what will they discover at the end of their journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Main features\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1784802650\" height=\"106\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"800\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging asymmetrical co-op gameplay \u2014</strong> Control two vastly different characters to reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A unique hybrid form \u2014</strong> Through the young girl, pilot the Mech-ute to unlock new abilities and create a unique cooperative experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Special Abilities \u2014</strong> Upgrade your Mech-ute to help you out of any predicament.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Activate your Abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a character's powers\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Interact with the Environment</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"A gif showcasing different possible interactions\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Collect Lore</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"A gif showcasing various lore elements to collect\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Meet Cute Robots</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.webp?t=1784802650\"/><img alt=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"600\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"About the team\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1784802650\" height=\"106\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are\u00a0<strong>Tempete Studio,</strong>\u00a0a small independent video game studio located in Poitiers, France. Our goal is to bring joy to people through our games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We previously collaborated with <i>Libellud</i> on <i><strong>Dixit World</strong></i>, the mobile adaptation of\u00a0the popular board game <i>Dixit</i>. Building on this experience, we set out to develop our first original game. We wanted to tell a heartfelt story about a little girl and a big robot centered around hope and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Wishlist today and follow for updates\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1784802650\" height=\"293\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1784802650\" width=\"800\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In a post-apocalyptic world, a young girl and a defective robot called \"Mech-ute\" band together in order for him to fulfill his mission. Lost in Tandem is a colorful, relaxed-paced, 2D adventure-puzzle game, which can be played by one to two players via couch co-op.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/b30057db344f5955e95d8ab0257ba228d879edac/header.jpg?t=1784802650", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["2D Platformer", "Adventure", "Puzzle Platformer", "Local Co-Op", "Story Rich", "Cute"], "developers": "Tempete Studio", "publishers": "Tempete Studio", "release_date": "Jul 22, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "3846580", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/zwCrM5Abp9g", "first_seen": 1780610400.0, "review_rank": 466}